'''Dew''' was a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Dew was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.
== Appearance ==
The blade on the knife has a neon color and a logo, a silver hilt and a red handle.

== Trivia ==
* The logo on the blade is from the popular soda company called [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mountain_Dew Mountain Dew].
*When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had the Mountain Dew logo removed from the blade and was renamed [[Festive]].
*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed for all the player's [[Inventory|inventories]].

